  "mermaid": "sequenceDiagram\n  participant boot as boot\n  participant sentinel_sensor as sentinel_sensor\n  participant trig_gpio as trig_gpio\n  participant echo_gpio as echo_gpio\n  participant timer_node as timer_node\n  participant sentinel_classifier as sentinel_classifier\n  participant led_gpio as led_gpio\n  participant app_task as app_task\n  participant wifi as wifi\n  participant mqtt as mqtt\n  participant logger as logger\n\n  boot->>logger: init logging\n  boot->>app_task: create/start app_task\n  boot->>sentinel_sensor: sensor_driver_start()\n  sentinel_sensor->>sentinel_sensor: xQueueCreate(1, sizeof(reading))\n  sentinel_sensor->>trig_gpio: gpio_config(TRIG as output), set_level(0)\n  sentinel_sensor->>echo_gpio: gpio_config(ECHO as input)\n\n  loop every APP_SAMPLE_PERIOD_MS\n    sentinel_sensor->>trig_gpio: set_level(1) for 10us then 0\n    sentinel_sensor->>timer_node: esp_timer_get_time() for deadlines\n    sentinel_sensor->>echo_gpio: wait_level(1) then wait_level(0)\n    sentinel_sensor->>sentinel_sensor: compute distance_cm + valid + timestamp\n  end\n\n  sentinel_classifier->>sentinel_sensor: sensor_driver_receive(timeout_ms)\n  sentinel_classifier->>led_gpio: set LED based on classification\n  app_task->>wifi: connect station(ssid/password)\n  app_task->>mqtt: publish record (/api/records)\n  mqtt->>logger: log publish result",
  "title": "Boot, Sensor Sampling, Classification, and Network Publish"
